        "original_id": "a92c46e4-6a4f-5600-8749-edfb7fad823b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Arthur Rudolph\n- Projects: clandestine postwar recruitment operation\n- Topics: U.S. space program, post-Nazi Germany, German scientists and engineers\n\nFacts:\n- In post-Nazi Germany, a clandestine recruitment operation brought more than 1,600 German scientists, engineers, and technicians into U.S. work.\n- Arthur Rudolph was one of the people recruited through that clandestine postwar operation.\n- Arthur Rudolph later became one of the main developers of the U.S. space program in the 1960s.",
